/local
/.runtime/
/node_modules/
/GeneratedInputs
__pycache__/
.letta/
# A personal variant of the working contract stays local; AGENTS.md itself is tracked.
/AGENTS.local.md
**/bin/
**/obj/
# Compiled product UI: generated by the host build, never edited by hand.
src/ui/generated/

# Throwaway probe files a review lane runs inside the tree and deletes afterwards.
# A probe that fails still fails the suite; this only keeps it out of commits.
tests/**/Temp*Tests.cs
# Review-lane probes use whatever temporary name the lane picks; treat any of them as
# disposable so one committed probe cannot happen again.
tests/**/[Tt]mp*.cs
tests/**/Temp*.cs

# Generated content packs: produced from the operator's own game data, never committed.
/content/partyrpg/imports/*
!/content/partyrpg/imports/README.md
